      "note": "THE CN REVEAL, derived from the TW one: the EN tour’s ids and enums, field for field, with nothing in it to translate but the \`ask\`. See the EN sidecar’s note for the design. REVEAL_VOCAB carries a zh table since 2026-08-10, so the role words render in Chinese beside Chinese labels (the vocab-table addition the 2026-08-08 chrome ruling deferred).",
